stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Normalized: schema accepted
    Normalized --> PolicyChecked: fingerprint calculated
    PolicyChecked --> Denied: policy failure
    PolicyChecked --> ReadyForReview: accepted bundle
    state "ready_for_review (local immutable proposal)" as ReadyForReview
    ReadyForReview --> ExternalReview: operator publishes exact inputs
    state "external GitHub evidence" as ExternalReview
    ExternalReview --> Planned: protected plan
    Planned --> Applied: protected approval and exact saved plan
    Applied --> Drifted: manual read-only drift
    Applied --> RolledBack: reviewed rollback
    Applied --> Destroyed: two-stage destroy
    ExternalReview --> Rejected: review or guard failure
    note right of ExternalReview
      External events do not change
      local ready_for_review state
    end note
    Denied --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Drifted --> [*]
    RolledBack --> [*]
    Destroyed --> [*]
